      "description": "Data repository for solar and meteorological ground measurements from a network of weather stations in West Africa. The data is provided in the framework of the West African Power Pool project: \"Solar Development in Sub-Saharan Africa - Solar resource measurement campaign in West Africa”. Funding is provided by World Bank. Measurement Date Range: - Lossa: 2022-01-23 – 2024-01-22 - Maradi: 2022-02-02 – 2024-02-01 - Zabori: 2022-02-10 – 2024-02-09",
